msgid "Creates a real sign-in account for them, already able to use this institution's portal with the role you pick below. Share the email and password you set here with them directly — KUSANYA doesn't email credentials."
msgstr "Inaunda akaunti halisi ya kuingia kwa ajili yao, tayari wanaweza kutumia lango la taasisi hii kwa wajibu unaochagua hapa chini. Wape barua pepe na nenosiri ulilotumia hapa moja kwa moja; KUSANYA haitumi vitambulisho kwa barua pepe."

msgid "Creates a real sign-in account, already able to use KUSANYA with the access you grant below. Share the email and password you set here with them directly — KUSANYA doesn't email credentials."
msgstr "Inaunda akaunti halisi ya kuingia, tayari inaweza kutumia KUSANYA kwa ruhusa unayotoa hapa chini. Wape barua pepe na nenosiri ulilotumia hapa moja kwa moja; KUSANYA haitumi vitambulisho kwa barua pepe."

msgid "Creates the institution and its first admin account directly, already active -- no separate approval step, since you're the approver. Give the sign-in email and password you set to that admin yourself; KUSANYA doesn't email credentials."
msgstr "Inaunda taasisi na akaunti yake ya kwanza ya msimamizi moja kwa moja, tayari hai -- hakuna hatua tofauti ya idhini, kwa kuwa wewe ndiye mwenye kuidhinisha. Mpe msimamizi huyo barua pepe na nenosiri la kuingia ulilotumia mwenyewe; KUSANYA haitumi vitambulisho kwa barua pepe."

